  abilityDesc: 18 combo Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    6 combo Fire attack on single foe, boosts spark damage for 4 turns, boosts critical
    damage for 4 turns, damage taken fills BB gauge for 4 turns & boosts Atk, Def,
    Rec and critical rate for 4 turns
